 "remarks": "This thoughtfully updated and well maintained four-bedroom Cape offers two renovated full bathrooms, flexible living spaces and inviting outdoor areas. New main-level hardwood floors and fresh interior paint complement a kitchen with stainless steel appliances, including a Sub-Zero refrigerator and wine cooler. Upstairs, two generously sized bedrooms feature built-in drawers and closets, along with a renovated full bathroom.  The finished lower level adds flexible space for relaxing, working or entertaining, complete with a wet bar and walkout access to a refinished stone patio with an electric retractable awning. A low-maintenance Trex deck, added in 2025, overlooks the level backyard with planted privacy trees.  Additional improvements include a replacement water heater, upgraded 200-amp electrical service, grounded outlets, a new chimney flue and cap, and a storage shed. Convenient to shopping, dining, Metro-North, I-95 and Norwalk's beaches and parks, with the added benefit of deeded beach rights.",
